== diags.diag/becomes-on-ref-parameter
BYN7011 20:5 `pay` changes the state of `order`, a `ref` parameter; a state changes in place only through `ref this`
  help take `order` by `move` and return the new state as a value
BYN7011 14:9 `pay` changes the state of `other`, a `ref` parameter; a state changes in place only through `ref this`
  help take `other` by `move` and return the new state as a value
